  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions. SQL generation is now dialect-aware (SqlDialect) for SQL Server and PostgreSQL; APIs take a DataBridge instead of the removed EF DbRepository.",
